      <h2 id="cert-manager-operator-release-notes-1-20-0_cert-manager-operator-release-notes" class="group scroll-mt-20">cert-manager Operator for Red Hat OpenShift 1.20.0<a href="#cert-manager-operator-release-notes-1-20-0_cert-manager-operator-release-notes" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">Review the release notes for the cert-manager Operator for Red Hat OpenShift 1.20.0 to learn what is new and updated with this release.</p>
      <p>Issued: 2 July 2026</p>
      <p>The following advisories are available for the cert-manager Operator for Red Hat OpenShift for OpenShift Container Platform 1.20.0:</p>
      <ul>
      <li><a href="https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2026:34294">RHBA-2026:34294</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2026:34309">RHBA-2026:34309</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHBA-2026:34336">RHBA-2026:34336</a></li>
