      <h3 id="cert-manager-operator-1-19-1-fixed-issues_cert-manager-operator-release-notes" class="group scroll-mt-20">Fixed issues<a href="#cert-manager-operator-1-19-1-fixed-issues_cert-manager-operator-release-notes" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
